{"id":10000051,"name":"优菈","enName":"Eula","title":"浪沫的旋舞","element":"冰","region":"蒙德","rarity":5,"weapon":"双手剑","birthday":"10月25日","constellation":"浪沫座","description":"古老家族出身的「浪花骑士」，西风骑士团游击小队队长。身为旧贵族后裔却加入了堪称死对头的西风骑士团，该事件至今仍是蒙德一大谜团。","affiliation":"西风骑士团","cv":{"chinese":"子音","japanese":"佐藤利奈","english":"素汐·杨","korean":"金炫志"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000051-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000051-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Eula.zip","voicePackageEn":"Eula","quoteCount":79,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"西风骑士团，游击小队队长，「浪花骑士」优菈·劳伦斯，向你致以问候…嗯，劳伦斯，没错。如你所见，我是罪人的后裔，是骑士团的内鬼，正在向他们复仇。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/4674nyx4oam94j3w1v5hmt6ok3xjy6d.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·礼仪","desc":"骑士和贵族的礼仪一脉相承，只是前者脚踏实地，简化了繁文缛节。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/n4q4frntr2c6ivrpiwtm39vk3a4ie2y.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·剑技","desc":"西风剑术？想和我学两手吗？等你学成再找你报仇，想必能增添不少乐趣。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/ofb98786tuh927c3mls5ch5qksw9ryy.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·规矩","desc":"贵族们的陈腐规矩啊…听听就好，哪怕像我一样，被迫背诵了几百条，也不必当真。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/4ai0t3kjclcdczczhg31liez9rdhv2p.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"快到伞下来，别被淋湿了。要是你得了病，身体早早就垮掉，那我找谁报仇去？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/61/of33jra1pne03h5wp5vk66c9q9tt88d.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"麻烦的天气，雷声会干扰听觉，影响我对周边的感知。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/3l5hc4op2qhgahgp9pb9dpjaze0r5kp.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"视野不错！登上高地，就能将周围的敌情尽收眼底。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/59/s3oxvgd2q2c8awsgg4tsbfrjof34b21.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"该起床了，日出前两个小时，值岗一夜的哨兵最为疲惫，是我们活动的绝佳时间！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/qsdt3xi9qtw2ewo8wtk30lc3hfd09kt.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"午饭要少吃谷物，多吃肉类，防止午后困倦，被人趁机暗算。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/h5ylkf2gdrveufs58pircisns150eyu.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"「愿柔风伴你，度过安详的一夜。」…旧贵族的问候语里，难得有这么中听的一句。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/0bmllrh2oj54mwkn2oag4v7da5ra3ro.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"想听骨哨的催眠曲吗？会让你长睡不醒…但这样的报仇方法，实在太无聊了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/e3cfc5h0aoe9mb31dj8mf5iktrn5k73.mp3"},{"title":"关于优菈自己·骑士","desc":"打入敌人内部，不就能更方便地复仇了吗？所以我才加入骑士团啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/6u5jxidetjss8g2cppdpuno3mxu8uaf.mp3"},{"title":"关于优菈自己·态度","desc":"既然成为了西风骑士，基本工作还是要尽职的，不然就连混日子的庸人们都不如了。哪怕是罪人，也不能这么丢脸。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/rlu47f6yolqwn5yj67zza6zz9flhata.mp3"},{"title":"关于优菈自己·游击","desc":"游击骑士的职责是自由狩猎敌军，或者在侧面战场牵制敌人，没有太多规矩，更符合我的作风。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_idle3","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/1y9uj6sg174flx0mbggp5jjrzyvqsu5.mp3"},{"title":"关于优菈自己·舞蹈","desc":"劳伦斯家的传统倒也不全是糟粕，至少「祭礼之舞」纯净而高洁，让我心境平和，给过我不少慰藉。这么多年来，我一直没有放下它，每个舞步都刻进了我的身体…所以，言归正传，想要学到只属于我的「西风剑术」，还得先过舞蹈这关。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_idle4","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/51/emea1shhiyl6igs4jr5kld6bi5sne1t.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·共性","desc":"其实我们俩有点像，对于蒙德，我们都是「外人」。只不过，你这个外人受到欢迎，而我一直被提防，被人敌视。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/74/fwbs8ie3sqf42ty5nen8sr0uey8j1uy.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·复仇","desc":"你还会和我结下更多仇的，不如就等到哪天一并清算吧，这样能省掉不少麻烦。也许是十年后，二十年后…放心，我不会忘的。在那之前，你可要生龙活虎，平安无事啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/t3dvwy5bzzl17l8w1noszmvpyqw8mzp.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"「罪人的后裔」，这个名号不太中听，我只有不断用我的方式复仇，才能彻底摆脱它。想要复仇就需要力量，得到「神之眼」，也是情理之中的事吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/069tmrch4mtr5d3u5liwqao40r9pjbj.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·骨哨","desc":"我的骨哨能吹出各种音色，迷惑敌人，相当实用。我经常用它吹奏海浪的声音，「浪花骑士」的称号就是这样来的。但没人在乎，这骨哨的技艺起源于璃月。毕竟他们也不会去深究…一个被蒙德排斥的罪人，找了个被人遗忘的璃月人当老师嘛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/gukpc52hr6kw9twvztavduvt9txvdri.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·品酒","desc":"按理说，陈酿蒲公英酒要搭配银杯，醒酒十二分钟后加入冰块，酒面没过冰块六成为宜。但这样实在太麻烦了，我可不乐意。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_share_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/lg6x8n56dbgohcxg3e0c0kcmsirzpcd.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"冰雾花呀，怎么就这么罕见呢？它制作的粉末有奇效，能让骨哨的音色变得更通透。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f4/gx7bvaam3my5vxrhyjfxsdpmqk2cg2h.mp3"},{"title":"关于安柏…","desc":"安柏总是自作主张，我刚加入骑士团那天，她替我打扫宿舍，带我四处参观，之后也主动帮我搞定各种麻烦事。在别人看来，我就像是个被妹妹照顾的姐姐，这怎么像话！这些仇，我都记下了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_ambor_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/ah91a14dsf6zr2yl13j3lo2hp9zqebs.mp3"},{"title":"关于琴…","desc":"代理团长啊，她和我的家族是宿敌。但她公私分明，认可我的实力，邀请我加入骑士团，给了我不少机会。所以我考虑在复仇时，赏她一个不算难看的败北。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_qin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/9ckp71cdl72f27brwhy6xj794ff3wbp.mp3"},{"title":"关于丽莎…","desc":"啊，麻烦的女人，她的脑袋里装着几千本书，也许是几万本。她能随口数落劳伦斯家的黑历史，每件事的日期都很准确。按理来说，她能帮我追查某个人的下落，可我又拉不下脸去找她。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_lisa_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/ba/jepaqu7f55e1veef6x01u67f2rqvd8v.mp3"},{"title":"关于芭芭拉…","desc":"她到底有什么秘诀，这么讨人喜欢？要是能和她学两招…哦不，还是算了吧，「偶像」和「罪人的后裔」，怎么想都不合拍。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_barbara_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/493lkugpbnym1ldxnu4l16bihaksn2a.mp3"},{"title":"关于法尔伽…","desc":"大团长啊，他的性格很直爽，不在乎琐事和传闻，算是个老好人吧。我和他切磋过一次，打成了平手，但他那轻松的表情，散漫的态度，绝对是在放水！是对我最大的轻视！这个仇，我绝不会忘的！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_varka_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/sk6i4y9mpbz2d21cmxbh3e6cj5l8cw7.mp3"},{"title":"关于温迪…","desc":"那个吟游诗人唱过几首歌，把劳伦斯家放进轻快的故事，用从没听过的口吻调侃，连我都憋不住笑…这个仇，我不会忘的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_venti_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/r51du9cr1j4ka1hlxoicm4246v4mc1d.mp3"},{"title":"关于雷泽…","desc":"不用拘泥于礼仪，不必在乎他人的目光，也没有所谓的家族责任…他的生活方式，还蛮轻松的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_razor_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/ddu9jahjbeku8p04qwn12j4m6mjv02d.mp3"},{"title":"关于砂糖…","desc":"那个炼金术士？她给过我一种装置，说是能用来潜入深渊教团的营地，结果却发出巨响爆炸了，害我当场暴露，被十三个丘丘暴徒围攻。事后我本来想找她算账，可看她慌张又内疚的样子，还有墙上贴着的失败记录，我也不好说什么。反正我没受伤，只是灰头土脸，有点丢人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_sucrose_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/4h16m9lcacaqd4dxq0l6hpbr8o31aov.mp3"},{"title":"关于迪卢克…","desc":"我和骑士团的某些人不对付，他也看骑士团不顺眼，理论上，我俩是一边的。但他总是对人不理不睬的样子，感觉比代理团长还麻烦。唉，我可不想和他打交道。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_diluc_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/1jn4aeo16ze7txrwiobo7m4bm95zh66.mp3"},{"title":"关于迪奥娜…","desc":"她呀，是个奇妙的调酒师呢，居然和我聊得来。她为了毁灭蒙德酒业在酒馆工作，而我为了向骑士团复仇加入了骑士团，天下还有这么巧的事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_diona_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/0bia3rbxhcpieibt2y66tjn8ij9l4y4.mp3"},{"title":"关于烟绯·相识…","desc":"说来话长…有次我们追踪深渊教团的一批危险品，碰巧救下了她。当时，教团的危险品被伪装成普通货物，要从荆夫港转运到璃月港，她是跟随商船的顾问，发现货物有鬼，就擅自进行了调查，结果引火上身。要是我们再晚几分钟到，她就要倒大霉了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_yanfei_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/n2lsqkpl39jhr6qx3rku3tnbou9iyp1.mp3"},{"title":"关于烟绯·看法…","desc":"之后我们一直保持着联络，我还蛮喜欢她那股机灵劲儿的。她牢记规矩，但懂得变通，如果骑士团里的某些人能学学她就好了。而且，凭她的本事，应该能帮我找到那个人。就当是她还上欠我的人情了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_yanfei_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/akzyhjpl6garv9h03rn6grkyx3moefr.mp3"},{"title":"关于米卡·沟通","desc":"米卡被分来游击小队的时候，我以为他会像之前某些人一样，没干几天就想走了。没想到他不声不响，任务却完成得相当出色，还主动承担了所有跑腿的任务，替我和其他人沟通。哼，一个两个都想着照顾我，也不知道是谁教出来的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_mika_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/43/afrqa3hvzm9bh91yz3v1t98bnyzrcc7.mp3"},{"title":"关于米卡·回归","desc":"这次米卡从远征队回来，性格没什么变化，实力倒是强劲了不少。看来大团长没有怠慢对大家的训练。嗯？你说他自己都没发现？那是他迟钝吧…或者说，谦虚。毕竟是我小队的成员，这种事，看一眼就知道了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_teammate_mika_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/s85qndjq4mzq6sk9k8j4338lbhad53b.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解优菈·其一","desc":"罪人的经历，有什么好了解的？反正不管说什么做什么，都会被敌视，被当成潜在的危险分子吧。现在还算好了，没加入骑士团的时候，猎鹿人和蒙德百货都不愿意卖东西给我，吃饭都得去野外打猎生火自己做。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/75/ctcpwcid0417swz9hi9pxkcn41hkctr.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解优菈·其二","desc":"有人劝过我低声下气，谨言慎行，说这样也许能获得谅解，但他们会这么想，只是因为他们没当过真正的「罪人」。…「罪人」是不会轻易被原谅的，那还不如洒脱一点，上门复仇，堂堂正正地去较量。要是赢了我，我听凭处置，可要是输了，就得满足我的要求。比如…唉，至少也要好好地把东西卖给我吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/50t3wnd62nnj3msv2z1j43xcq1onjue.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解优菈·其三","desc":"西风骑士团倒还挺像样的，至少他们更看重一个人的「才能」而非「身份」。当年我和他们的精锐切磋过几次，用实力折服了他们，所以收到了入团邀请。在骑士团内部工作，复仇更方便了，生活中的麻烦也减少了，何乐而不为呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/kootrehvsejniywh3289ti7lmlzqgqb.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解优菈·其四","desc":"劳伦斯家族是在堕落后才背负恶名的，在此之前，这个姓氏也曾满载荣耀，可惜所有人都像是忘掉了那段历史。大团长说我作为骑士，干得还算不错，不说找回劳伦斯最初的荣光，至少是对片面观点的迎头痛击。这个说法倒是挺合我意的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/gz1oqaexw36r3g680e2vpbjqh996ulc.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解优菈·其五","desc":"如果家族里的那些人一直执迷不悟，甚至继续荼毒蒙德，那他们和劳伦斯这个姓氏，就该被我亲手抹杀…这大概是我唯一想要履行的「家族责任」吧。在那之后，我就随意改个姓氏，由你来起都没问题！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fe/ingu5r1sgnv9ozy3qsot05i1tv9v2ke.mp3"},{"title":"优菈的爱好…","desc":"凉爽的事，我都很中意。比如，痛饮冰镇后的酒和饮料，坐在峡谷山口享受狂风，或者跳进龙脊雪山山脚的湖里泡澡。哈，没准哪天你在湖边晃荡，会被我拖进冰水里哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/3jukodfhz8idkgo5mh8zpg9sw9t85j5.mp3"},{"title":"优菈的烦恼…","desc":"有的时候酒馆生意太火爆，我被要求和人拼桌。听说我是劳伦斯家的人，摆谱的、挑衅的、明着暗着使绊子的，就从各种地方冒出来了，唉，还让不让人好好喝酒了？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/r62jh6tty7jl3vmh6fb7vd4fcqs9yzx.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"我喜欢亲手做点心，点心不一定都是甜品，比如冰镇后的番茄肉冻蛋卷，就很适合搭配冰树莓薄荷酒。重要的是，有些人吃到我做的点心，就会笑得很开心。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/75/do85fklerxp66ch6wg4ah4tant4t2gv.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"浓郁的汤品，我实在不能接受。口感太厚重，饱腹感很强，影响运动和战斗，还不方便携带，简直是我的天敌。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/8k6a54lod85e6s2egff8oj9v92y0ibl.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"哦？这是对我的挑战吗。我接受了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c6/qo48ymv0okfibvky30tt3nhi9c0b9fk.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"马马虎虎嘛…你自己也尝尝？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/agng73cz9tkm9ibqeo3urj74kymxntp.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"你这家伙，是在报复我吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/6859zmvi8i08ksp43am0ldys6i0t18d.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"今天是个值得纪念的日子，但你的成长不能只限于年龄。送你一个特制骨哨，跟我学学吹奏的方法吧。等到我向你报仇的那天，你可以试试，用这枚骨哨干扰我，拖延时间，挣扎得更有趣一些吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a8/bpafgz7c1rtjhszwi7toomnhwyuywri.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"战技提升了不少，但还不值得沾沾自喜。骑士团里也有不少家伙格外勤奋，要想战胜他们完成复仇，必须远远将他们甩在身后。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/1ebgvkuf355cf341q7gcrzq76s2bekm.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"不错，以我现在的实力，哪怕和代理团长一较高下，也十拿九稳了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/qrb3livm1o9sfoxertp03y9whiu3p15.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"奇怪…和你同行时，力量增长得格外迅猛呢。看来和你结仇是件走运的事，我得紧紧咬住你不放了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/sbmab34ht82zuypy530aeinnxy0751d.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"很好！这股坚冰的力量已被我牢牢掌控。别说代理团长，大团长都没法再阻挡我了！事不宜迟，我可以制定计划，发起总攻了。挫败西风骑士团之后，下个目标就是你，你也别想逃，乖乖待在我身边，见证这一切吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_eula/vo_eula_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d9/fm310r2cacmlyo6t9a9odehzkzrrgbt.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"求饶吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/ajyg1fxmixnft9tjp4hguy05mxg6w6a.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"结霜！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/j3v9yrdmw21tfb1ekes8b5i7fz8kldi.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"粉化！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c7/6rapykdxic7emngm8o1ns56masz14b6.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"判决！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/jj172cgq2ab7rn46jxmsc966eab2w0w.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"破碎！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/a0uggwp6ousvr9vjqhwv5095u2tn8s4.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其六","desc":"以眼还眼！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/96/529fdgqebnekznki14l87nf8b5sftd9.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"冰浪怒涛！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bc/9f6vemljp7zdtp2dn92kix4jtl6gltb.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"以霜还怨！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/p40xibukagqe8lqlzhr7l88gro6mll5.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"坚冰，断绝深仇！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/m5wateif0rpm5n0kdjsg5whffgcz23f.mp3"},{"title":"冲刺开始·其一","desc":"加快脚步。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_explore_sprint_start_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/3b4k2md9atf1dvbzj31cak9nuvzla5s.mp3"},{"title":"打开风之翼·其一","desc":"空中行动，视野更棒。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_explore_fly_start_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a0/obwgshqv8bqxl46vxlz5n5nzcjx74d8.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"有所发现。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/t8j4ayrjte1pmheldq530xypi94z9nw.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"嗯，大多能派上用场。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/p1u3os65f74psruenchlwaaumfzakoa.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"罪人也有这么走运的时候啊…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/dc1jtdyu9gmp3xdvmuhiaphcsuvyna4.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"开战不利…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ef/igfyum4ecw6nx85uetngt9hzyek8897.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"要正式接敌了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/bqa9woe892pwt6aeleylb1ofs0a9cn9.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"不赖嘛！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_eula/vo_eula_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8b/qtrck1uw6vy5pbmpikz2fbecy8ya2rf.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·